#! ██╔══██╗██╔══██╗  ████╗░██║██╔══██╗╚══██╔══╝  ██╔════╝██╔══██╗██║╚══██╔══╝
#! ██║░░██║██║░░██║  ██╔██╗██║██║░░██║░░░██║░░░  █████╗░░██║░░██║██║░░░██║░░░
#! ██║░░██║██║░░██║  ██║╚████║██║░░██║░░░██║░░░  ██╔══╝░░██║░░██║██║░░░██║░░░
#! ██████╔╝╚█████╔╝  ██║░╚███║╚█████╔╝░░░██║░░░  ███████╗██████╔╝██║░░░██║░░░
#! ╚═════╝░░╚════╝░  ╚═╝░░╚══╝░╚════╝░░░░╚═╝░░░  ╚══════╝╚═════╝░╚═╝░░░╚═╝░░░

# Sourced by every zsh (interactive or not): keep it to environment only.
# Interactive modules (aliases, widgets, tool hooks) load from .zshrc.

export XDG_CONFIG_HOME="$HOME/.config"
export EDITOR=nvim
export SUDO_EDITOR="nvim -u $HOME/.config/nvim/init.lua"
export MANPAGER='nvim +Man!'
export MANWIDTH=100
export aurhelper=yay

# Secrets (API keys, tokens) — file is gitignored, create it manually
[[ -f "$HOME/.config/zsh/secrets.zsh" ]] && source "$HOME/.config/zsh/secrets.zsh"
